#: ../../source/docs/common-wireless-gcs-repeater.rst:27
#: 307568afa3124647a19debf35082c46a 33464d814bd14fdeb34888cc06287961
#: 4c533714a60149dea75d1e80d7309e3e 699703d42d934cd8a1592d672eb69a3a
#: a012b2cd0a474ecca9f7b7d8230c5932 e1f0f4381b5740c5a38f195b3d5c5a1c
msgid ""
"Telemetry receiver such as a Sik radio. Preferably, the vehicle version "
"since USB connection is not used, but a USB version can be easily converted "
"for this application. See section below."
msgstr "数传接收机，如 SiK 无线电。优先使用飞行器版本（不带 USB 连接），但 USB 版本也可轻松改造用于此应用。见下文章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wireless-gcs-repeater.rst:28
#: 1eff70ea29cf4acaa5b8b8c1f106641b 262b254430f541cc9c5b33a7078ed527
#: 26a350972ad34251b40f79c0d05a5e4b 410e311784264503b9a06a17fcae4c95
#: bd37c6f1f74f4cc0a445e7ea5903e839 e14e49ea8d98469d8692180b69b94ee9
msgid ""
"Either an HC-06 Bluetooth module, or ESP8266 WIFI module. For use with a "
"phone, either works well, with WIFI having further range than Bluetooth. For"
" computer GCS, since most portable PCs do not have BT integrated, WIFI may "
"be the best choice since most PCs have this integrated."
msgstr ""
"HC-06 蓝牙模块或 ESP8266 WIFI 模块之一。用于手机时两者均可，WIFI "
"比蓝牙传输距离更远。用于电脑地面站时，由于大多数便携电脑未集成蓝牙，WIFI 可能是更好的选择，因为大多数电脑已集成 WIFI。"

